WEBVTT

00:28.030 --> 00:29.030
Huh?

00:55.390 --> 00:57.100
The heck?! What's that lady's problem?

00:57.100 --> 00:58.800
I could tell she was smirking at me

00:58.800 --> 01:00.660
like "you don't have a chance, dear!"

01:00.660 --> 01:03.300
And Prince Clarke was getting all gaga!

01:03.300 --> 01:05.740
Ugh, why is that so painful?

01:05.740 --> 01:08.170
What in the world is wrong with me?

01:14.530 --> 01:17.780
The sky is shedding tears for my sa—

01:17.780 --> 01:19.020
Wha?!

01:20.670 --> 01:22.600
Hmm? Lettie?

03:15.540 --> 03:17.280
Lettie's been kidnapped?

03:17.280 --> 03:18.830
We've received word that

03:18.830 --> 03:22.180
a carriage bearing the royal 
crest of Delbaran took her away.

03:22.610 --> 03:24.430
What did the gatekeepers report?

03:24.810 --> 03:26.730
Nothing out of the ordinary.

03:28.640 --> 03:29.850
Prince Clarke!

03:31.000 --> 03:34.240
It appears the carriage was headed
 toward the western woods.

03:34.240 --> 03:38.430
Through there, it's only a short 
journey along the coast to Delbaran.

03:38.430 --> 03:40.710
This will get tricky if they cross the border.

03:41.200 --> 03:42.190
Sebastian.

03:42.190 --> 03:43.270
Yes?

03:43.270 --> 03:47.040
Attend to our guests as normal 
to avoid any commotion.

03:47.040 --> 03:48.790
As you wish.

03:49.310 --> 03:52.800
And you, see to it that no one
 spreads careless rumors.

03:52.800 --> 03:54.140
Yes, sir.

03:54.140 --> 03:56.100
Nadir, we're going after them.

03:56.100 --> 03:57.100
Right.

04:00.550 --> 04:03.830
Gentlemen, please find her safe.

04:16.950 --> 04:19.710
Hey! Quit ignoring me!

04:19.710 --> 04:23.210
What? Attendants should 
stay out of the carriage!

04:23.910 --> 04:26.690
You want me outside in the pouring rain?

04:26.690 --> 04:29.900
Please, allow me to take shelter in here!

04:29.900 --> 04:31.900
Ah, I'm soaked...

04:31.900 --> 04:34.290
Stay away! You'll get me wet!

04:34.290 --> 04:37.590
Huh? Have you no mercy, man?

04:37.590 --> 04:39.210
You can't call me "man"!

04:39.630 --> 04:44.010
Why am I always stuck getting
the short end of the stick?

04:40.220 --> 04:41.250
<i>Huh?</i>

04:44.010 --> 04:47.180
Come on, what are you even grumbling about?

04:51.580 --> 04:53.590
Hey, I think she just moved.

04:53.590 --> 04:55.820
Perhaps she woke up.

04:59.590 --> 05:01.680
Hurry up and remove the hood.

05:05.450 --> 05:06.200
Ma—

05:08.600 --> 05:10.210
Who the hell is this chick?

05:10.210 --> 05:11.260
I wonder.

05:11.260 --> 05:15.990
How could you have confused this
 weird little runt with my darling Maria?

05:15.990 --> 05:18.540
I had to sneak into a castle 
to find a specific person!

05:18.540 --> 05:21.190
Do you understand the kind 
of pressure that puts on a guy?!

05:21.190 --> 05:23.090
You're totally out of line here!

05:23.090 --> 05:25.800
Hmph. Only an imbecile
 would make such an excuse.

05:25.800 --> 05:26.640
Huh?!

05:30.480 --> 05:32.480
"Would you get over yourselves?!"

05:32.480 --> 05:33.900
State your name.

05:33.900 --> 05:35.400
"I can't talk! Take this off!"

05:35.770 --> 05:38.970
Don't we need to remove the gag first?

05:38.970 --> 05:42.360
I mean... Why don't we just 
dump her here instead?

05:42.820 --> 05:44.030
"Wait, what'd you just say?!"

05:44.480 --> 05:45.680
Let her out.

05:45.680 --> 05:47.160
Okay, okay.

05:47.160 --> 05:48.660
"Stay back, you pig!"

05:49.030 --> 05:51.870
Just try to stay calm, okay?

05:51.870 --> 05:52.870
"Hyah!"

05:52.870 --> 05:53.370
"Take that!"

05:55.450 --> 05:59.760
Take me back to the castle this instant 
or you're going to be in serious trouble!

06:02.520 --> 06:04.010
Now, state your name.

06:04.010 --> 06:07.810
I am Leticia, daughter of Duke Dorman

06:08.210 --> 06:12.560
and fiancée to His Highness,
 Crown Prince Clarke of Astarl.

06:12.870 --> 06:14.270
The prince's...

06:14.270 --> 06:16.010
Fiancée?

06:16.390 --> 06:18.570
This is bad news. What should we do?

06:18.570 --> 06:20.890
Would it change anything if we went back now?

06:20.890 --> 06:22.480
No, probably not.

06:22.480 --> 06:23.770
I think you're right.

06:23.770 --> 06:25.450
Let's just ditch her somewhere.

06:25.450 --> 06:26.330
Yes, let's.

06:26.330 --> 06:28.070
Wait! Wait, wait, wait!

06:28.070 --> 06:32.030
Guys, are you seriously thinking 
about abandoning a helpless maiden

06:32.030 --> 06:33.970
in the middle of a dark forest?

06:33.970 --> 06:37.580
If it means saving ourselves
and our country...

06:37.580 --> 06:38.960
Why not?

06:38.960 --> 06:41.420
Wuh?! You brutes!

06:44.080 --> 06:44.930
Slip...

06:44.930 --> 06:47.150
Whoa! Hold it right there!

06:47.150 --> 06:50.180
M-Maria! I have information about Maria!

06:50.640 --> 06:53.640
Do you really? You'd better not be lying.

06:53.640 --> 06:56.060
I'm not lying! I see her every day!

06:57.140 --> 07:00.400
Fine then. Tell me something about her.

07:00.400 --> 07:05.740
First, untie me. 
Then I'll tell you all about Maria.

07:10.940 --> 07:12.540
And that's when it happened!

07:12.860 --> 07:18.180
Maria took my hand and smiled at me. 
Her smile was as beautiful as an angel's!

07:18.180 --> 07:22.350
I'd never seen anyone so lovely before.
I was completely spellbound.

07:22.350 --> 07:28.050
Also, her perfect hand was so delicate 
and smooth and soft as it held mine.

07:28.050 --> 07:29.690
And she smelled really nice.

07:29.690 --> 07:33.190
My heart was pounding like waves
 against the shore! Ah!

07:33.190 --> 07:35.580
From that moment, I knew I
 was destined to be with her—

07:35.580 --> 07:36.810
Fast-forward!

07:38.400 --> 07:41.550
This here is the third prince 
of the Kingdom of Delbaran,

07:41.550 --> 07:43.200
Prince Louis Delbaran.

07:43.200 --> 07:44.700
You're a Delbaran prince?!

07:44.700 --> 07:45.850
Heh heh.

07:45.850 --> 07:49.260
Lady Maria was a count's
 daughter in our homeland.

07:49.260 --> 07:51.760
She and His Highness were
very close, like siblings—

07:51.760 --> 07:55.310
Not like that! You're supposed 
to say "like lovers"!

07:55.310 --> 07:56.550
Sure, sure.

07:56.550 --> 08:01.080
However, Lady Maria's family fell into ruin
and she disappeared.

08:01.410 --> 08:06.520
We later learned she'd become
a lady-in-waiting at Astarl's royal castle.

08:06.520 --> 08:11.430
That was around the time Prince Louis 
received an invitation to tonight's ball.

08:11.430 --> 08:13.760
Why, may I ask, did you
suddenly decide to abduct her?

08:14.280 --> 08:16.300
I protested, of course.

08:16.300 --> 08:19.210
But this shithead prince here 
never listens to anyone.

08:19.210 --> 08:21.310
What do you mean by "shithead"?

08:21.310 --> 08:23.020
Exactly what it sounds like.

08:23.020 --> 08:24.010
Oh yeah?

08:24.010 --> 08:27.740
Oh, and as for myself, 
I am Prince Louis's attendant, Lyle.

08:28.330 --> 08:29.360
Hello.

08:29.360 --> 08:31.950
Enough with the self-introductions!

08:31.950 --> 08:35.070
At any rate, it's clear to me 
that Prince Louis is a sad little boy

08:35.070 --> 08:38.270
indulging in a completely 
one-sided infatuation.

08:38.270 --> 08:41.300
I'm relieved that you understand.

08:41.300 --> 08:42.880
Hey, don't call me a little boy!

08:42.880 --> 08:47.500
Oh, pardon me. I suppose you are at 
the age when you try to act all grown-up.

08:48.340 --> 08:49.450
Shaddap, you!

08:49.450 --> 08:50.870
Pfft!

08:50.870 --> 08:52.430
Now, listen well.

08:52.430 --> 08:53.470
Hmm?

08:52.430 --> 08:53.470
Huh?

08:53.470 --> 08:55.720
I know what we should do next.

08:58.680 --> 09:01.410
You will take me straight 
to the Kingdom of Delbaran.

09:01.410 --> 09:05.310
In addition to reparations for kidnapping me,
you will provide me money, land,

09:05.310 --> 09:07.360
and a house where I can live
as a humble commoner.

09:07.360 --> 09:11.050
We will return you to Astarl, saying that 
we brought you under our protection

09:11.050 --> 09:14.350
after finding you abducted 
by bandits on our way home.

09:14.350 --> 09:18.400
As a reward for saving you, 
we'll ask for Maria's hand for Prince Louis,

09:18.400 --> 09:20.870
and I will not be charged 
with any wrongdoing.

09:20.870 --> 09:24.590
As long as I get Maria for myself, 
I don't care either way.

09:25.020 --> 09:27.900
It's almost shocking
 how different out plans are.

09:27.900 --> 09:30.640
But we must find a peaceful resolution.

09:30.640 --> 09:34.440
Yes, or diplomatic relations between 
our kingdoms will be strained.

09:34.440 --> 09:39.140
Anyway, this is all your fault
 for grabbing the wrong girl.

09:39.140 --> 09:41.510
Must you bring that up again?

09:41.510 --> 09:43.360
Would you two at least <i>try</i> to get along?

09:43.360 --> 09:44.480
No way!

09:43.360 --> 09:44.480
Absolutely not!

09:46.940 --> 09:48.230
What's all this?

09:48.230 --> 09:50.500
What? It's seafood, obviously.

09:50.500 --> 09:52.030
It looks delicious!

09:52.030 --> 09:53.810
Let's dig in!

09:56.250 --> 09:57.910
Mm, delicious!

09:57.910 --> 09:59.930
This restaurant was a great choice!

09:59.930 --> 10:03.820
There are many delicious seafood 
restaurants in Delbaran as well.

10:03.820 --> 10:05.550
Wuh? That sounds nice!

10:05.550 --> 10:09.400
I'm always under curfew, so I don't know 
anything about dining in the royal capital.

10:09.400 --> 10:13.050
Is that right? 
Princess lessons sure must be tough.

10:13.050 --> 10:17.350
Oh, but the fish I caught was 
wonderful grilled with a little salt!

10:17.350 --> 10:19.500
Do you enjoy fishing, my lady?

10:19.500 --> 10:21.820
Yes. I even make my own flies.

10:21.820 --> 10:23.490
Wow, that's impressive!

10:24.810 --> 10:26.820
Oh dear. What's the matter?

10:26.820 --> 10:28.550
Your Highness! Are you all right?

10:29.420 --> 10:32.070
What the hell is this?! 
An assassination attempt?!

10:32.400 --> 10:35.570
Are you perhaps referring to the fish bone?

10:35.890 --> 10:38.570
There, there. 
I'll pull the bones out for you, okay?

10:38.570 --> 10:41.220
Prince Louis is very sheltered.

10:41.220 --> 10:41.930
Hey!

10:41.930 --> 10:42.990
I can tell.

10:42.990 --> 10:43.830
Hey!

10:45.210 --> 10:48.210
Why did we stop to rest at an inn anyway?

10:48.670 --> 10:51.530
I wanna take a bath at the end of the day.

10:51.530 --> 10:53.690
I'm sure you can hold out for a night.

10:53.690 --> 10:58.060
I don't wanna! I want to be all clean
before I go to dreamland.

10:58.060 --> 11:00.720
But if our pursuers show up, we're done for.

11:00.720 --> 11:05.980
I'd rather not do it in this dirty old inn.
I wanna use the castle's golden bath!

11:05.980 --> 11:08.480
Sounds like something Brianna would love!

11:08.480 --> 11:10.980
It's molded in the shape of a duck!

11:15.040 --> 11:16.240
I suppose we've no choice.

11:16.580 --> 11:19.610
First thing tomorrow, 
we'll set out for my kingdom.

11:19.610 --> 11:24.000
Once we cross the border, 
Astarl won't be able to lay a hand on us.

11:24.470 --> 11:27.160
That should prevent this from
escalating to a diplomatic issue.

11:27.160 --> 11:31.600
We can negotiate our respective positions 
from the safety of our own kingdoms.

11:31.600 --> 11:35.230
As for Maria, I need time 
to work out another strategy.

11:36.550 --> 11:38.320
Oh, Your Highness!

11:38.320 --> 11:42.040
Are you feeling funny or something 
after eating all that strange food?

11:42.040 --> 11:43.640
Are you mocking me?!

11:46.140 --> 11:50.270
This is a popular inn, so we were 
only able to get two rooms.

11:50.780 --> 11:54.380
You're the prince's attendant, 
so shouldn't you be together?

11:54.380 --> 11:57.440
There's no way I'm sharing 
a room with anyone.

11:58.110 --> 12:00.960
I'm in no position to complain.

12:00.960 --> 12:03.150
Sorry, but I'm not sharing either.

12:03.150 --> 12:06.750
A man and woman of age can't well
share a room for the night, can they?

12:06.750 --> 12:10.670
Why the heck not? You've got 
no sex appeal in the first place.

12:10.670 --> 12:13.090
What'd you say?! You'd better rephrase that!

12:13.090 --> 12:14.870
I'm bursting at the seams with sex appeal!

12:14.870 --> 12:16.010
I'm as womanly as they come!

12:16.010 --> 12:19.010
You don't look womanly at all! Not one bit!

12:19.010 --> 12:20.160
Argh!

12:20.160 --> 12:20.980
Hmph!

12:20.980 --> 12:25.290
Please stop fighting! 
I don't want to cause a scene!

12:25.290 --> 12:26.370
Lyle...

12:26.370 --> 12:28.010
I guess that settles it.

12:28.870 --> 12:31.290
Your Highness, Lady Leticia...

12:31.290 --> 12:32.600
You can stand guard.

12:32.600 --> 12:34.690
You'd better stay close to the doors.

12:34.690 --> 12:36.150
Wait, huh?

12:39.980 --> 12:41.390
You're kidding me.

12:44.090 --> 12:45.790
Great! Time to escape!

12:45.790 --> 12:50.650
Even if I do make it to Delbaran, 
I don't think they'll respect my wishes at all.

12:50.650 --> 12:53.590
I still have some money left from 
selling my dress and jewelry.

12:53.590 --> 12:55.460
I should be okay for a while!

13:08.170 --> 13:10.190
I smell a path to freedom!

13:10.540 --> 13:14.090
Well, Prince Louis and Lyle, 
we had a pretty good run.

13:14.090 --> 13:16.870
Wah! Please forgive me!

13:18.360 --> 13:19.190
Wuh?

13:24.320 --> 13:26.060
Prince Clarke?!

13:39.640 --> 13:44.220
Lettie, now why in the world would you be 
spending the night with another man?

13:44.220 --> 13:45.350
<i>That's</i> your question?

13:45.350 --> 13:50.350
We found Lady Leticia on the road 
and have been protecting her since!

13:50.830 --> 13:53.400
They did not! They kidnapped me!

13:53.400 --> 13:55.360
No, we protected you!

13:55.360 --> 14:01.460
And yet Lady Leticia wanted to run off 
and live like a commoner in Delbaran!

14:01.460 --> 14:03.910
Traitor! Lyle, you're the worst!

14:03.910 --> 14:06.370
I value my life.

14:06.370 --> 14:08.710
How could you?! We even shared a meal!

14:08.710 --> 14:10.910
In truth, I don't care for seafood.

14:10.910 --> 14:14.640
For shame! You said it was 
delicious and kept coming back for—

14:15.600 --> 14:18.410
You two do seem like very close friends.

14:19.580 --> 14:23.010
Why don't you tell me 
all about it back at the castle?

14:24.030 --> 14:25.270
Oh, sorry!

14:26.260 --> 14:29.820
Hey! What's the deal with this shabby inn?

14:29.820 --> 14:33.170
There's nobody around to bathe me. 
What's up with that?

14:33.760 --> 14:36.100
Go get the person in charge!

14:37.100 --> 14:38.770
Your Highness...

14:39.740 --> 14:42.440
Ah, pleased to meet you.

14:42.440 --> 14:46.280
I'm the third prince of the Kingdom 
of Delbaran. My name is Louis.

14:46.280 --> 14:50.450
I rescued Lady Leticia after she was abducted 
and have been protecting her.

14:50.740 --> 14:52.450
So you'd betray me too!

14:52.450 --> 14:55.050
I want some free time too, you know?!

14:55.050 --> 14:57.180
Why do I have to eat 
that monstrous-looking junk?

14:57.180 --> 14:58.700
Ah, I hate, I just hate this!

14:58.700 --> 15:02.170
This is why I never wanted to be 
the third prince's attendant!

15:02.650 --> 15:03.610
Pardon me.

15:04.620 --> 15:07.480
Erm, I apologize for all the commotion.

15:07.480 --> 15:10.080
I will see that they quiet down,
so return to your rooms.

15:10.080 --> 15:10.780
Oh boy.

15:10.780 --> 15:11.510
Sheesh.

15:11.510 --> 15:13.340
Right when it was getting good!

15:18.690 --> 15:19.690
You never care about my feelings!

15:19.690 --> 15:20.690
Why can't you listen to me 
for a single d—

15:20.690 --> 15:21.690
And I want to go horseback riding and...

15:21.690 --> 15:23.500
What in the world is going on?

15:29.130 --> 15:31.450
What do you think you're doing?!

15:40.390 --> 15:43.150
If you continue to be so noisy,
you'll cause problems for us all.

15:43.150 --> 15:46.130
Don't you agree, Prince Clarke? Leticia?

15:46.610 --> 15:47.730
You're right.

15:48.860 --> 15:51.160
As for the Delbarans...

15:51.730 --> 15:53.510
That's Prince Louis and Lyle.

15:54.900 --> 15:57.670
Prince Louis. Lyle.

15:57.670 --> 15:58.550
Yes?

15:58.550 --> 16:00.150
I cannot apologize enough.

16:00.540 --> 16:03.680
In order to get closer with Prince Clarke,

16:03.680 --> 16:08.970
Prince Louis decided to make friends 
with Leticia and invited her on an outing.

16:08.970 --> 16:10.300
Isn't that right?

16:10.890 --> 16:13.670
Hold on, Brother! I was kidnapped, you know?!

16:13.670 --> 16:15.220
You keep your mouth shut.

16:15.660 --> 16:17.220
Yeah, that's right!

16:17.220 --> 16:20.670
I just wanted to make friends 
with Lady Leticia. That's all!

16:21.110 --> 16:25.280
That appears to be what happened. 
Is that acceptable, Your Highness?

16:25.280 --> 16:26.820
Yes. Fine by me.

16:26.820 --> 16:28.070
Grr!

16:28.070 --> 16:29.000
Heh!

16:29.000 --> 16:32.030
Prince Louis, why don't we 
find you some clothes?

16:32.030 --> 16:33.900
Let us return to your room for now.

16:33.900 --> 16:35.010
Okey-dokey!

16:39.040 --> 16:40.310
Um...

16:40.310 --> 16:46.320
Now why in the world would you be on a 
first-name basis with other men, I wonder?

16:46.320 --> 16:48.400
You even shared a meal, you said?

16:48.400 --> 16:50.570
You must be very angry.

16:50.570 --> 16:52.280
Yes. Extremely.

16:53.060 --> 16:57.520
Speaking of which, the seafood soup
 here is terribly delicious!

16:58.130 --> 17:00.790
Uh, erm...

17:00.790 --> 17:02.510
I'm sorry.

17:03.650 --> 17:04.540
Wuh?

17:20.640 --> 17:22.350
Your Highness?

17:25.380 --> 17:29.070
Let's return to the castle. 
If we leave now, we'll be home by morning.

17:36.450 --> 17:40.460
The only thing I truly need is freedom!

17:41.830 --> 17:42.570
Hyah!

17:42.570 --> 17:44.040
Wuh? D'oh!

17:48.410 --> 17:51.060
You know, you're really predictable.

17:51.060 --> 17:52.300
Bruffer?

17:52.670 --> 17:56.430
We have the whole village covered, 
so there's no way you'll be able to escape.

17:56.430 --> 18:00.270
Now get on back. For the sake of my future.

18:00.880 --> 18:03.350
Your reaction to this 
is so terrible, it's shocking.

18:03.350 --> 18:04.950
I'll take that as a compliment.

18:05.480 --> 18:08.230
I'm going to make sure you 
get married, no matter what.

18:08.230 --> 18:09.300
No way.

18:09.300 --> 18:11.570
<i>What</i> is your <i>problem</i>?

18:12.360 --> 18:14.320
The problem is I won't be free.

18:14.320 --> 18:18.270
That's all you care about. 
His Highness is very kind.

18:18.270 --> 18:21.200
He cares about you deeply. 
And that's the truth.

18:21.620 --> 18:23.400
You'll never find a better spouse.

18:23.400 --> 18:26.580
He'll respect your wishes 
so long as you don't run away.

18:26.580 --> 18:28.270
You'll still be free.

18:28.270 --> 18:30.300
That may be true, but...

18:30.660 --> 18:31.850
Jeez.

18:32.220 --> 18:34.040
Wuh? Brother?!

18:34.040 --> 18:35.150
We're going back.

18:36.220 --> 18:41.570
Listen, I just want to make sure my sister 
marries someone who will make her happy.

18:41.570 --> 18:43.640
That's how much I care about you.

18:43.640 --> 18:46.400
You can't start saying nice stuff now.

18:47.680 --> 18:50.350
Try to look him straight in the eye for once.

19:07.750 --> 19:09.250
Missus!

19:09.250 --> 19:11.400
It is such a relief to see you safe!

19:12.140 --> 19:14.890
I was so, <i>so</i> worried about you!

19:14.890 --> 19:18.700
Thank you, Maria. 
I'm sorry for making you fret.

19:18.700 --> 19:21.080
I'll make you a warm cup of herbal tea.

19:21.080 --> 19:23.420
Maria!

19:23.420 --> 19:24.310
What?

19:24.310 --> 19:26.770
Maria!

19:26.770 --> 19:28.050
Prince Louis?!

19:32.860 --> 19:35.210
I've missed you, Maria!

19:35.210 --> 19:36.630
What brings you here?

19:36.630 --> 19:39.490
Your Highness, don't forget your manners.

19:39.490 --> 19:41.130
And Lyle too?

19:41.130 --> 19:43.800
Lady Maria, it has been a while.

19:43.800 --> 19:47.550
They're making preparations for me to do 
an exchange study in Astarl right now,

19:47.550 --> 19:50.250
so I'll be with you for a while, Maria!

19:51.330 --> 19:52.560
That's going to be a problem.

19:52.560 --> 19:55.760
Oh, don't act so happy! You'll embarrass me.

19:55.760 --> 19:58.920
We look forward to spending time 
with you again, Lady Maria.

19:58.920 --> 20:00.000
I'd rather not.

20:01.220 --> 20:03.070
Things are going to be lively around here.

20:03.890 --> 20:07.840
Brother, what is all this about 
Prince Louis and an exchange study?

20:07.840 --> 20:12.130
I figured you wouldn't try to run away 
if you weren't so bored.

20:12.510 --> 20:14.040
You like excitement, don't you?

20:14.040 --> 20:15.560
Well, yes.

20:17.780 --> 20:19.880
Missus, please help!

20:19.880 --> 20:22.250
Prince Louis, what do you think you're doing?

20:22.250 --> 20:25.120
What's your problem, runt? Outta my way!

20:25.120 --> 20:28.310
I will not let you lay a single finger 
on my lady-in-waiting.

20:28.310 --> 20:31.480
Nadir, you're on my side, aren't you?

20:31.480 --> 20:33.820
Yes, of course I am, Your Highness.

20:33.820 --> 20:35.920
Your room is being prepared as we speak.

20:35.920 --> 20:38.380
Oh, I know. 
Would you like to go see it now?

20:38.380 --> 20:42.010
You're so reliable! 
The exact opposite of Lyle here.

20:40.970 --> 20:42.010
What?!

20:42.010 --> 20:43.860
Let's have lunch tomorrow.

20:43.860 --> 20:45.430
What?

20:43.860 --> 20:45.430
It would be my pleasure.

20:45.430 --> 20:46.720
Your Highness!

20:46.720 --> 20:48.640
That's my brother for you.

20:48.640 --> 20:51.200
Ah, that was close!

20:54.770 --> 20:56.420
Where's Prince Clarke?

21:02.090 --> 21:04.450
Huh? Wha— Oh!

21:04.450 --> 21:08.300
I think I just saw something. 
I'm sure I saw something!

21:13.270 --> 21:15.280
What do we have here?

21:22.470 --> 21:25.070
His Highness is having an affair?

21:25.070 --> 21:27.770
I can't tell anyone about this!

21:27.770 --> 21:30.300
Maria!

21:35.400 --> 21:37.180
Maria, run faster!

21:37.180 --> 21:38.400
Please, missus!

21:43.530 --> 21:46.190
I don't believe it!

23:19.920 --> 23:39.940
<b>Next Time</b>

23:20.040 --> 23:25.050
My, don't you seem cheerful, Matthias!

23:20.920 --> 23:25.930
Don't just pay attention to Matthias. Pay attention to me too

23:21.920 --> 23:26.930
So as long as you're not totally opposed, you'd welcome it if he follows the proper steps, no?

23:22.920 --> 23:27.930
Don't come on to someone else's lady-in-waiting

23:23.920 --> 23:28.930
I can't let you out of your room

23:25.930 --> 23:30.930
I can't believe they're even stricter than before. Bah!

23:27.300 --> 23:32.310
If anything happens to Leticia, ring this to let me know

23:28.800 --> 23:33.810
Starting today, I'll leave Leticia in your care

23:30.300 --> 23:35.310
Your Highness, I know what you're up to!

23:31.850 --> 23:36.810
And then... wearing that dress, I became even more lovely

23:37.270 --> 23:39.940
To be, or not to be... That is the question
